OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after being hit by
OL,4,Aambulance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after being struck by an
OL,7,Fambulance transporting a patient near
OL,8,FSunderland, police have said.
OL,10,FNorthumbria Police said the crash
OL,11,Foccurred on the A19, between the
OL,12,Fjunctions for the A1018 and A690,
OL,13,Fshortly after 02:00 GMT.
OL,15,FThe ambulance was travelling on the
OL,16,Fnorthbound carriageway and did not have
OL,17,Fits blue lights on when it hit the man,
OL,18,Fwho was in his 30s and died at the
OL,19,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
